nemies</span><em>Closeness below 0</em></div></div></div><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"on\"><i></i><span>Strangers</span></div><div class=\"\"><i></i><span>Getting close</span></div><div class=\"\"><i></i><span>Something's there</span></div><div class=\"\"><i></i><span>The talk</span></div><div class=\"\"><i></i><span>Together</span></div></div><p class=\"sm\" style=\"margin-top:12px;line-height:1.6\">They're guarded. Talk first — everything else opens from here.</p><p class=\"xs dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Next: “Getting close” · Closeness 5 / 20</p><div class=\"meter\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><i style=\"width:25%\"></i></div><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">What to do next</div><div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:6px;margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"task next\" data-task=\"chat\"><span class=\"ck\"></span><span class=\"grow\">Talk 10 turns (0/10)</span><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">›</span></button><button class=\"task\" data-task=\"quiz\"><span class=\"ck\"></span><span class=\"grow\">Take a sync quiz</span><span style=\"color:var(--gold)\">›</span></button></div><p class=\"af73rules\">💗 Affinity grows through real interaction: chat each day (first visit +2), do the tasks below, and make choices he cares about in the story. Chat adds up to +15 a day; it never drops on days you're away. Each level pays diamonds and unlocks more free inner-voice reads.</p></div></div>"
